From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MihaZupan <miha@mihubot.xyz>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:10:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] branding: preserve Molly text and essential product resources

Port the retained Molly semantic intent directly onto stable Signal 8.34.2.
Source, API, resource and build integration are adapted to this target;
the earlier extraction's unmodified-blob claims do not apply here.

Upstream-baseline: 515db93fb48206d63406cbfb48c5816f6af1d9e2
Prior-version-input: c71034a86560940792154396f4c08a309fb56324
Semantic-boundary: 26/36

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/components/settings/app/subscription/receipts/detail/DonationReceiptDetailScreen.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/components/settings/app/subscription/receipts/detail/DonationReceiptDetailScreen.kt
